{#
  Discovery index for AI agents, following the llms.txt convention
  (https://llmstxt.org). An index, not a copy: it points at the sections and
  their pages, and holds no guidance of its own.

  Generated entirely from the folder structure. The Design System subsections
  are its child index pages, and each page sits under the subsection whose
  folder holds it, so a new page or a new subsection appears without editing
  this file. A page sets `llms: false` in its front matter to stay out.

  Audience: agents building OTHER projects against this design system. Agents
  working ON the design system have the repo, so methodology/ and mockups are
  not listed here at all.

  `| ascii | safe`: this output is plain text. `safe` stops Nunjucks turning
  apostrophes and ampersands into HTML entities; `ascii` keeps the file free of
  characters that mojibake when Pages serves text/plain without a charset.
-#}
