# {{ site.name | ascii | safe }}

> {{ site.summary | ascii | safe }}

Built with Bootstrap 5 and Font Awesome 6. Section headings link to their
rendered landing pages. Every page listed under them is available as Markdown --
fetch those `.md` URLs rather than the rendered HTML, which is mostly
navigation chrome.

Reference pages carry each component's real markup in fenced `html` blocks,
generated from the live page so they cannot drift. When copying from one, take
the component element itself and drop the surrounding `.row` / `.col-*`
wrappers, which only lay the demo out beside its description.

Prefer Bootstrap's own classes and the documented component classes over
bespoke CSS. To load the design system in a project, start with
{{ site.origin }}{{ '/design_system/using-ucld.md' | url }}

